    "Political": "Politique", "Search": "Recherche", "Shopping": "Achats", "Social": "Réseaux sociaux", "Tech": "Tech", "Video": "Vidéo", "NSFW": "NSFW",
    "Also run Maigret (needs uv, a few minutes)": "Lancer aussi Maigret (demande uv, quelques minutes)",
